# qmldir — explicit module manifest for modules/launcher/ (quick task
# 260822-sht, Task 1). Mirrors every sibling module manifest's own standing
# instruction (modules/qmldir:1-11, modules/dashboard/qmldir,
# modules/settings/qmldir): checking this file in disables Quickshell's
# directory-scanner synthesis for this directory entirely — any .qml type
# added here that is NOT declared below becomes unresolvable to shell.qml's
# `import "modules/launcher"` forever, with no load error. Any FUTURE type
# added to this directory (Tasks 2-9 each add one or more) MUST be declared
# in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# LauncherState carries BOTH `pragma Singleton` in its own file AND the
# `singleton` keyword here — modules/qmldir's binary-verified finding:
# without the qmldir keyword, bare `LauncherState.query`-style access
# resolves to `undefined` forever (the object is never constructed).
# Launcher is deliberately NOT a singleton — it is the PanelWindow instance
# mounted once by shell.qml's launcherLoader, matching Dashboard/Overview's
# own non-singleton shape in the parent modules/qmldir.
#
# CalcMode/WebSearchMode/FilesMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 2) are
# plain Item-rooted mode result views, loaded by Launcher.qml's results
# Loader — same non-singleton shape as Launcher itself. `fuzzy.js` needs NO
# entry here: only `.qml` TYPES require qmldir registration; a plain
# `import "fuzzy.js" as Fuzzy` relative-path JS import resolves without one
# (fuzzy.js's own header note).
#
# MenuTree (quick task 260822-sht, Task 3) is a singleton — a static data
# model, same rationale as LauncherState: `pragma Singleton` in-source AND
# the `singleton` keyword here, or bare `MenuTree.roots` access resolves to
# `undefined` forever. MenuMode is a plain Item-rooted mode result view,
# same non-singleton shape as CalcMode/WebSearchMode/FilesMode above.
#
# SystemInfoMode/UpdatesMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 4 — R-1/R-2) are
# plain Item-rooted mode result views, same non-singleton shape as every
# other mode above.
#
# PickerMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 5, extended Task 6) is a plain
# Item-rooted mode result view, same non-singleton shape as every other
# mode above. One type, three `pickerId` instances (Style ▸ Theme,
# Style ▸ Bar orientation, Capture ▸ Record toggle audio) — see its own
# header for the inversion-of-control shape all three consumers share.
#
# ConfirmMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 6) is a plain Item-rooted mode
# result view, same non-singleton shape — the destructive-confirm
# counterpart to PickerMode: non-destructive option first and preselected.
#
# EmojiMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 7) is a plain Item-rooted mode
# result view, same non-singleton shape as every other mode above. Reads
# emoji.tsv (also this directory, no qmldir entry needed — plain data,
# not a QML type) via FileView.
#
# ClipboardMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 8) is a plain Item-rooted
# mode result view, same non-singleton shape as every other mode above.
#
# KeybindsMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 9) is a plain Item-rooted
# mode result view, same non-singleton shape as every other mode above.
module qs.modules.launcher
singleton LauncherState 1.0 LauncherState.qml
singleton MenuTree 1.0 MenuTree.qml
Launcher 1.0 Launcher.qml
CalcMode 1.0 CalcMode.qml
WebSearchMode 1.0 WebSearchMode.qml
FilesMode 1.0 FilesMode.qml
MenuMode 1.0 MenuMode.qml
SystemInfoMode 1.0 SystemInfoMode.qml
# UpdatesMode RETIRED 2026-08-28 (quick task 260828-75k) — System >
# Updates opens the package workbench instead.
PickerMode 1.0 PickerMode.qml
ConfirmMode 1.0 ConfirmMode.qml
EmojiMode 1.0 EmojiMode.qml
ClipboardMode 1.0 ClipboardMode.qml
KeybindsMode 1.0 KeybindsMode.qml
# WallpaperMode (quick task 260826-wl3) — the horizontal wallpaper carousel
# with live preview, reached via `qs ipc call launcher open wallpaper`.
# Declared in the same commit that creates it, per this manifest's own rule.
WallpaperMode 1.0 WallpaperMode.qml
# PkgMode (quick task 260828-75k) — the `+` route. Plain Item-rooted mode
# result view, same non-singleton shape as every other mode above.
PkgMode 1.0 PkgMode.qml
# IconMode/FontMode (quick task 260828-ah9, D-01) — the `icon`/`font` word
# routes, Specimen's typed half. Plain Item-rooted mode result views, same
# non-singleton shape as every other mode above. Declared in the same
# commit that creates them, per this manifest's own rule.
IconMode 1.0 IconMode.qml
FontMode 1.0 FontMode.qml
# CommandMode (quick task 260829-2ov) — the `cmd` word route, MenuTree's
# leaves flattened into one searchable list. Plain Item-rooted mode result
# view, same non-singleton shape as every other mode above. Declared in the
# same commit that creates it, per this manifest's own rule.
CommandMode 1.0 CommandMode.qml
